# 13. Detection Mantığı

DCSync için güçlü detection sinyali:

```text
Event ID 4662
+
Properties içinde replication GUID’leri
+
Subject Account Name DC machine account değil
+
Kaynak sistem domain controller değil
```

Replication GUID’leri:

```text
1131f6aa-9c07-11d1-f79f-00c04fc2dcd2
1131f6ad-9c07-11d1-f79f-00c04fc2dcd2
89e95b76-444d-4c62-991a-0facbeda640c
```

Basit SIEM mantığı:

```text
IF EventID == 4662
AND Properties contains any replication GUID
AND SubjectUserName does not end with "$"
AND SubjectUserName not in approved replication accounts
THEN Alert: Possible DCSync Activity
```

Daha iyi mantık:

```text
IF EventID == 4662
AND replication GUID observed
AND source host is not a Domain Controller
AND account is not allowlisted
THEN High Severity DCSync Alert
```

